---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Layers: the app sees a tiny key-value interface; the storage engine hides the mess below it.
const W = 900;
const H = 290;
---
<figure class="abs">
  <div class="abs-scroll">
    <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Abstraction layers: application code calls a two-function key-value interface. Under it, the storage engine hides pages, indexes, caching and crash recovery, and under that the raw disk blocks.">
      <text x="24" y="30" class="abs-h"><tspan data-lang-en>What the caller sees</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Phần người gọi nhìn thấy</tspan></text>
      <rect x="24" y="42" width="360" height="52" rx="6" class="abs-top" />
      <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={56} y={68} size={26} />
      <text x="204" y="66" text-anchor="middle" class="abs-n"><tspan data-lang-en>Application code</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Code ứng dụng</tspan></text>
      <text x="204" y="85" text-anchor="middle" class="abs-s">put(key, value)   get(key)</text>

      <line x1="204" y1="94" x2="204" y2="114" class="abs-edge" />
      <rect x="24" y="114" width="360" height="40" rx="6" class="abs-mid" />
      <text x="204" y="139" text-anchor="middle" class="abs-n"><tspan data-lang-en>Key-value interface</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Giao diện key-value</tspan></text>

      <text x="440" y="30" class="abs-h"><tspan data-lang-en>What is hidden underneath</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Phần được giấu bên dưới</tspan></text>
      <rect x="440" y="42" width="436" height="224" rx="6" class="abs-hide" />
      {[
        { y: 62, icon: 'index', en: 'Index: B-tree or LSM-tree', vi: 'Index: B-tree hoặc LSM-tree' },
        { y: 112, icon: 'log', en: 'Cache and write-ahead log', vi: 'Cache và write-ahead log' },
        { y: 162, icon: 'retry', en: 'Crash recovery and compaction', vi: 'Khôi phục sau crash và compaction' },
        { y: 212, icon: 'disk', en: 'Raw disk blocks and sectors', vi: 'Block và sector thô trên đĩa' },
      ].map((l) => (
        <g>
          <rect x="460" y={l.y} width="396" height="36" rx="5" class="abs-layer" />
          <DiagramIcon name={l.icon} x={488} y={l.y + 18} size={24} />
          <text x="658" y={l.y + 23} text-anchor="middle" class="abs-n"><tspan data-lang-en>{l.en}</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>{l.vi}</tspan></text>
        </g>
      ))}
      <line x1="384" y1="134" x2="440" y2="134" class="abs-edge" />
      <text x="24" y="190" class="abs-s">
        <tspan data-lang-en>Change the engine underneath and callers do not notice.</tspan>
        <tspan data-lang-vi>Đổi engine bên dưới thì người gọi không hề hay biết.</tspan>
      </text>
    </svg>
  </div>
</figure>

<style>
  .abs { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .abs-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .abs svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .abs text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .abs .abs-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .abs .abs-n { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; fill: var(--text); }
  .abs .abs-s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .abs-top { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); }
  .abs-mid { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); }
  .abs-hide { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .abs-layer { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); }
  .abs-edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
</style>
